  "script": "Imagine a monument that changes with the light. The Taj Mahal stands beside the Yamuna River in Agra. Its white marble glows softly at sunrise and shines beneath the moon. Look closer at the carved flowers, the balanced gardens, and the reflections in the water. Every detail invites you to slow down. Some places are more than buildings. They become stories that the world remembers.",
